    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight in-process server stub for Phase 5 timeout/shutdown tests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Simulates accept/reject/drain semantics without opening TCP ports. All operations are driven by <computeroutput>std::chrono::steady_clock</computeroutput> and protected by a <computeroutput>std::mutex</computeroutput> + <computeroutput>std::condition_variable</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
